---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="(Who am I) 我是谁" description="" pubDate={new Date('2026-08-06')} hideTitleDivider>
	<header class="about-intro">
		<!-- <p class="prompt"><span>~/qizi706</span> $ whoami</p> -->
		<p>
			我是周权，就读于中国科学技术大学软件学院，研究生二年级。对底层技术痴迷，喜爱研究
			<b>Linux（Arch 用户）</b>，熟悉 <b>C/C++ 语言</b
			>，目前在国内某大厂实习，工作内容是分布式存储。
		</p>
		<div class="status-line">
			<span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			<span>currently exploring: kernels · storage · AI infra</span>
		</div>
		<a class="github-link" href="https://github.com/Qizi706" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
			↗ github.com/Qizi706
		</a>
	</header>

	<section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
		<div class="section-label">01 / projects</div>
		<h2 id="projects-title">个人项目</h2>

		<details class="project" open>
			<summary>
				<span>MIT 6.s081</span>
				<small>RISC-V · xv6 · C · Linux</small>
			</summary>
			<div class="project-body">
				<p class="project-meta">2026.02 — 2026.04 · personal project</p>
				<p>
					以基于 RISC-V 指令集架构的微型操作系统 xv6
					为基础，对内存管理、进程管理、文件系统和中断处理等模块进行扩展与优化。
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>实现独立内核页表与用户页表映射机制，掌握 trampoline、trapframe 与页表切换流程。</li>
					<li>基于 page fault 实现 lazy allocation 与 copy-on-write fork，维护物理页引用计数。</li>
					<li>扩展 trap 与 syscall 机制，实现 alarm 系统调用和用户态定时回调。</li>
					<li>实现非抢占式用户级线程库，支持线程创建、上下文保存/恢复与协作式调度。</li>
					<li>扩展 xv6 文件系统，支持三级间接索引、软链接、mmap/munmap 与按需映射回写。</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</details>

		<details class="project" open>
			<summary>
				<span>CMU 15-445</span>
				<small>BusTub · C++ · Linux</small>
			</summary>
			<div class="project-body">
				<p class="project-meta">2025.11 — 2025.12 · personal project</p>
				<p>
					开发支持简单 SQL 操作的单机数据库 BusTub，覆盖缓冲池管理、B+
					树索引、查询执行器与多版本并发控制。
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						实现线程安全的 BufferPoolManager，维护 page/frame 映射、pin count、dirty flag
						与换入换出。
					</li>
					<li>实现 LRU-K 页面替换器，并与 Buffer Pool 的 evictable 状态协同工作。</li>
					<li>实现支持并发访问的 B+Tree 索引、节点 split/merge/redistribution 与有序迭代器。</li>
					<li>
						基于 Volcano Iterator 模型实现 Scan、Join、Aggregation、Sort、Limit、Distinct 等算子。
					</li>
					<li>实现规则优化器，将 SeqScan 改写为 IndexScan，将 NestedLoopJoin 改写为 HashJoin。</li>
					<li>基于版本链和 undo log 实现 MVCC，支持快照隔离下的并发读写。</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</details>
	</section>

	<section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="learning-title">
		<div class="section-label">02 / current quest</div>
		<h2 id="learning-title">2026.07 — 2026.08 学习路线</h2>
		<div class="quest-line">
			<input
				class="quest-checkbox"
				type="checkbox"
				disabled
				aria-label="AI Infra 全局认知尚未完成"
			/>
			<span>AI Infra 全局认知 <span class="muted">/ 2 weeks</span></span>
			<span class="quest-state" aria-hidden="true"></span>
		</div>

		<div class="learning-grid">
			<div>
				<h3>需要回答的问题</h3>
				<ol>
					<li>LLM 训练和推理有什么区别？</li>
					<li>一次请求如何经过 LLM Serving 链路？</li>
					<li>prefill、decode 和 KV Cache 分别解决什么问题？</li>
					<li>吞吐、延迟、TTFT、TPOT、显存利用率如何衡量？</li>
					<li>模型、推理引擎、调度器、GPU、网络、存储和监控如何协作？</li>
				</ol>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h3>阶段产出</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>跑通一个本地小模型推理。</li>
					<li>跑通一次 vLLM 服务。</li>
					<li>测试输入/输出长度对响应时间的影响。</li>
					<li>完成《LLM 推理系统从请求到返回的完整链路》笔记。</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<details class="reading-list">
			<summary>reading queue <span>展开阅读清单</span></summary>
			<div class="reading-columns">
				<div>
					<h3>理解 LLM 和 Transformer</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://jalammar.github.io/illustrated-transformer/"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer">The Illustrated Transformer</a
							>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://jalammar.github.io/illustrated-gpt-2/"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer">The Illustrated GPT-2</a
							>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<h3>理解推理和生成</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<a href="https://huggingface.co/blog/how-to-generate" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
								>How to generate text</a
							>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/llm_tutorial"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer">Transformers: Text generation</a
							>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>理解 KV Cache</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/cache_explanation"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer">KV Cache explained</a
							>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/llm_optims"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer">Optimizing inference</a
							>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<h3>性能与系统</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<a href="https://blog.vllm.ai/2023/06/20/vllm.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
								>vLLM + PagedAttention</a
							>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/design/kernel/paged_attention.html"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer">Paged Attention</a
							>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/benchmarking/llm/latest/metrics.html"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer">LLM Benchmarking Metrics</a
							>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</details>

		<pre
			class="pipeline"
			aria-label="LLM inference pipeline"><code>prompt
  -&gt; tokenizer
  -&gt; prefill  -&gt;  KV Cache
  -&gt; decode   -&gt;  scheduler / batching
  -&gt; response

constraint: KV Cache consumes GPU memory</code></pre>
	</section>

	<footer class="about-footer">
		<span>EOF</span>
		<span>keep building from the bottom</span>
	</footer>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-intro {
		padding: 0.25rem 0 1.75rem;
	}

	.prompt,
	.section-label,
	.project-meta,
	.status-line,
	.github-link,
	.quest-line,
	.pipeline,
	.about-footer {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
	}

	.prompt {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-size: 0.78rem;
	}

	.prompt span,
	.github-link {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.about-intro h2,
	.about-section > h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.about-intro h2 small {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.7em;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.about-intro p:not(.prompt) {
		max-width: 62ch;
	}

	.status-line {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin: 1.1rem 0 0.8rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-size: 0.72rem;
	}

	.status-dot {
		width: 0.45rem;
		height: 0.45rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #16a34a;
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgb(22 163 74 / 12%);
	}

	.github-link {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
	}

	.about-section {
		margin: 2.25rem 0;
	}

	.section-label {
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.about-section > h2 {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.project,
	.reading-list {
		margin: 0.8rem 0;
		border: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		background: rgb(255 255 255 / 28%);
	}

	.project summary,
	.reading-list summary {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem;
		cursor: pointer;
		list-style: none;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.project summary::-webkit-details-marker,
	.reading-list summary::-webkit-details-marker {
		display: none;
	}

	.project summary::before,
	.reading-list summary::before {
		content: '>';
		margin-right: 0.2rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
	}

	.project[open] summary::before,
	.reading-list[open] summary::before {
		content: 'v';
	}

	.project summary span,
	.reading-list summary {
		flex: 1;
	}

	.project summary small,
	.reading-list summary span {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.project-body {
		padding: 0 1rem 1rem;
		border-top: 1px dashed rgb(var(--gray-light));
	}

	.project-meta {
		margin: 0.75rem 0;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-size: 0.72rem;
	}

	.project-body ul,
	.learning-grid ul,
	.learning-grid ol,
	.reading-columns ul {
		padding-left: 1.35rem;
	}

	.project-body li,
	.learning-grid li,
	.reading-columns li {
		margin: 0.35rem 0;
	}

	.project-body li::marker,
	.learning-grid li::marker,
	.reading-columns li::marker {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
	}

	.quest-line {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
		padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
		border: 1px dashed rgb(var(--gray-light));
		background: rgb(226 232 240 / 24%);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.quest-checkbox {
		display: inline-grid;
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		place-content: center;
		width: 0.95rem;
		height: 0.95rem;
		margin: 0;
		border: 1px solid var(--accent);
		border-radius: 2px;
		appearance: none;
		background: transparent;
		opacity: 1;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.quest-checkbox::before {
		content: '';
		width: 0.5rem;
		height: 0.5rem;
		transform: scale(0);
		background: var(--accent);
		clip-path: polygon(14% 44%, 0 65%, 38% 100%, 100% 18%, 80% 0, 36% 68%);
	}

	.quest-checkbox:checked::before {
		transform: scale(1);
	}

	.quest-state {
		margin-left: auto;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-size: 0.7rem;
	}

	.quest-state::before {
		content: '[pending]';
	}

	.quest-checkbox:checked ~ .quest-state::before {
		content: '[done]';
		color: #15803d;
	}

	.muted {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}

	.learning-grid,
	.reading-columns {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.learning-grid h3,
	.reading-columns h3 {
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.reading-list {
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
	}

	.reading-columns {
		padding: 0 1rem 1rem;
		border-top: 1px dashed rgb(var(--gray-light));
	}

	.reading-columns h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
	}

	.reading-columns a {
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: rgb(var(--accent) / 35%);
	}

	.pipeline {
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
		border: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		background: rgb(226 232 240 / 45%);
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.about-footer {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding-top: 0.75rem;
		border-top: 1px dashed rgb(var(--gray-light));
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-size: 0.7rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 620px) {
		.project summary,
		.reading-list summary {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.25rem;
		}

		.learning-grid,
		.reading-columns {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 0.75rem;
		}

		.about-footer {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.3rem;
		}
	}
</style>
